SUMMARY:🐝 Bees\, Brunch\, & Wine 🍷 🐝 - A Beehive Experience - Oct
 ober 3\, 2026 🐝
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**The Orchard Inn & Spa\, and Newman
 ’s Restaurant in Saluda\, N.C. is offering an apiary (beehives) experien
 ce! For those who attended the Easter meetup there will recall what a beau
 tiful place the inn and restaurant was to experience.**\n\n**THE BEEHIVE E
 XPERIENCE: A seasoned beekeeper will be with us to look inside a honeybee 
 colony. Yes\, we will be inside bee suits! We will explore the hives\, do 
 honey tasting\, then have a sensory analysis. Afterwards we will have a ch
 arcuterie lunch inside Newman’s Restaurant and a complimentary wine or b
 eer. 🍷 🍺**\n**The event time is 3-4 hours.**\n\n**WHEN: There were d
 ifferent dates offered\, but I chose the very last one in October for seve
 ral reasons: The weather is far more pleasant in October\, especially when
  suited up in a bee suit!** **And October is such a beautiful month to enj
 oy the mountain scenery in Saluda with the changing of the leaves. 🍂 
 🍁**\n\n**COST: $125 total for the bee experience and lunch. Our bee sui
 ts will be provided. When you book your ticket it will ask you the size su
 it you want.**\n**Please go to their website to book your ticket.**\n\n**W
 EBSITE TO PURCHASE TICKETS:**\n**Sandybeemine.com**\n\n**IMPORTANT: Spots 
 are limited so please book soon!**\n\n**Questions/Concerns?**\n**Shae.keme
 rer@aol.com**\n**(828)699-8180 (Text or call)**
