SUMMARY:Fascinator Class by Monica - Hendersonville (NON-HOSTED) 👒
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**(THIS IS A NON-HOSTED EVENT AND FY
 I ONLY)** **Monica Mayer is offering a special class to make fascinators f
 or tea times\, parties\, Halloween\, etc. She thought our meetup group mig
 ht be interested and is doing this class just for the Senior Singles Fun B
 unchers!**\n\n**CLASS:** **The class will be held in The Tea Cottage adjoi
 ning The Emporium Market on 448 N. Main St.\, Hendersonville.**\n\n**COST:
 ** **$40 for the class instruction and all supplies except you must supply
  your own glue gun and glue sticks. Please pay in advance by Venmo or Zell
 e. Monica Mayer (954)629-3839. Otherwise\, please contact Monica to see ab
 out paying her by check or another method.**\n\n**INSTAGRAM PAGE:** **Fasc
 inators.by.Monica**\n**Look at her beautiful creations.**\n**She does not 
 have a website for she operates out of The Emporium Market.**\n\n**Please 
 RSVP on our meetup page if you wish to take the class.**\n\n**Questions?**
  **Please call or email Monica for more class details.**\n**Monica Mayer -
  (828)696-5340 (Shop) or**\n**(954)629-3839 (Home)**\n**Monica2056@msn.com
 **\n\n*******************A photo of her business card is in** **PHOTOS** *
 *of this event. Look below. 👇Click on photo to see all of it.**
