SUMMARY:The French Broad Chocolate Factory & Cafe ~ Factory Tour & Chocola
 te Tasting
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**The French Broad Chocolate Factory
  Tour consists of a classroom session which will cover the history of the 
 factory\, overview of the cacao farming\, and some yummy chocolate tasting
  where we will taste four different types of chocolate! 😋 Then we will 
 go on a guided tour of the chocolate factory where we will see the chocola
 te process making thru large viewing windows.**\n\n**TOURS:** **The tours 
 last 45-55 minutes. Please arrive 10-15 minutes early to check in at the c
 afe counter.**\n\n**COST:** **Adults ~ $12 plus tax = $14.23 total (no sen
 ior discount 😞)**\n\n**BOOK YOUR RESERVATION:** **You must book your re
 servation online for the tours are popular and limited in space. If you pl
 an on going please book now!! Be sure you book the** **BEAN TO BAR CHOCOLA
 TE FACTORY TOUR for October 16\, Friday at 1:00 PM.** **After you book the
 n RSVP here on this meetup**\n**event.** **Book your reservation on websit
 e below. ⬇️ By the way\, it was a bit confusing for me to find the tou
 r to book (it may be for you\, too) just look at the top of the page for t
 ours. If you still can’t get it please call me or call the factory direc
 t and have them book you. Good luck!**\n\n**WEBSITE:** **www.frenchbroadch
 ocolates.com**\n\n**GIFTSHOP & STORE:** **In case you want to buy chocolat
 e for your friends & family ~ or extras for yourself!**\n\n**CAFE:** **Aft
 er the tour we can stop in the factory cafe for even more chocolate (Yes!)
 \, baked goods\, bonbons\, ice cream\, coffee or wine. ☕️ 🍷 Menu is
  online at the above website.**\n\n**PARKING: 🅿️** **Parking is free 
 and on-site right next to the building. How convenient! There is handicapp
 ed parking available and a ramp up to the factory building.**\n\n**PETS:**
  **🐶** **Sorry ~ no pets allowed except certified service animals.**\n\
 n**I hope you will come join me. I’ve been wanting to do this tour for a
  long time. So come and let’s indulge in some chocolate together!! 😋*
 *\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS:**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**\n**(828)699-8180 (T
 ext or call)**
