SUMMARY:Great Smoky Mountains Railroad ~ Fall Excursion 🍂🚂🍁 (SOLD
  OUT!)
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\nAutumn is still quite a long ways of
 f\, but if you want to go on this railroad trip you should sign up now and
  book your seat with Globe Treks! They are only having 14 seats available 
 (open to us and the public) and I’m sure they will fill up fast for this
  is a very popular day tour!\nAnd a big thanks to both Gaby & Dawn for sug
 gesting this great day tour! Now come join us!\n\nThe Great Smokey Railroa
 d day trip is a Nantahala Gorge excursion where we would be on a steam-pow
 ered train riding in the crown class. We will also have lunch on the train
 . Fun!! 🤩\n\nThere is just too much to tell you to put in this descript
 ion section on Meetup. Therefore\, please go to Globetreks.com and click o
 n Day Tours. You should see the Great Smoky Mountains Railroad. A full des
 cription of what the trip entails will be there with the price\, etc. By t
 he way\, the price is $299 per person\, but so worth it! Only a deposit wi
 ll be required at this time.\n\nIMPORTANT\;\nif you decide to go (and I ho
 pe you do!) please RSVP on this meetup event after you have booked your se
 at with Globe Treks. To do this please call Robin (booking agent) at Globe
  Treks. (828)692-1399. She will handle everything for you. Also\, please t
 ell her you are with Shae’s meetup group so we all can be seated near on
 e another. Please book soon as you can! Just think what fun we will have! 
 Choo-Choo! 🚂🍁\n\nAny questions for me? Call/text or email me.\nShae.
 kemerer@aol.com\nCell: (828)699-8180
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/seniorsinglesfunbunch/events/31388452
