SUMMARY:Campfire Grill ~ (Meetup only for those attending the Christmas Sh
 ow)
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**NOTE: Due to Campfire Grill’s li
 mited reservation policy I had to limit this meetup to only those members 
 & their guests attending the Christmas Show at the Flat Rock Playhouse. 
 🎭**\n\n**Campfire Grill is a farm-to-table American restaurant in Flat 
 Rock known for its nostalgic summer camp theme and their mission to suppor
 t local camps.**\n**Campfire Grill offers indoor and outdoor seating. They
  also have a full bar. 🍹🍷🍺**\n\n**MENU: To view the menu please g
 o to: campfiregrillnc.com.**\n\n**LOCATION: The grill is only 0.4 miles fr
 om the Flat Rock Playhouse. You can just walk to it if you wish! Beats try
 ing to find a parking place!**\n**The Campfire Grill is located on Little 
 Rainbow Row. 🌈**\n\n**PARKING: 🅿️ Parking can be a hassle sometime
 s in just trying to find a place! That’s why I left some time from when 
 the play is over to our reservation time at the restaurant 4:30 PM. There 
 is some parking in the rear of the restaurant.**\n\n**Hope you will join m
 e! 😃**\n\n**QUESTIONS?**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**\n**(828)699- 8180 (T
 ext or call. I prefer text for I work\, but will return your call)**
